  - bioinformatics
  - genomics
abstract: >-
  Reshape-samplesheet reads an Illumina samplesheet (bcl2fastq or Local
  Run Manager format), matches Sample_IDs against a directory of fastq
  files produced by bcl2fastq (or any tool that uses the
  {SampleID}_S{N}_L00{Lane}_R{1,2}_001.fastq.gz naming convention), and
  emits a generic nf-core samplesheet (sample,fastq_1,fastq_2) that can
  be fed straight into an nf-core module. Pure Groovy — no Python, no
  extra runtime dependencies — so it works with any Nextflow install
  out of the box. Throws strict IllegalArgumentException errors on
  malformed input rather than producing silent partial output.
